## 🔹 Authentication Routes

### Register a new user
```
POST /api/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "John Doe",
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "role": "teacher",
  "department": "DEPARTMENT_ID"
}
```

### Login to get a token
```
POST /api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}
```

---

## 🔹 User Management (Admin Only)

### Get all users
```
GET /api/users
Authorization: Bearer ADMIN_TOKEN
```

### Get specific user details
```
GET /api/users/:id
Authorization: Bearer ADMIN_TOKEN
```

### Delete a user
```
DELETE /api/users/:id
Authorization: Bearer ADMIN_TOKEN
```

---

## 🔹 Department Management (Admin Only)

### Create a new department
```
POST /api/departments
Authorization: Bearer ADMIN_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mathematics"
}
```

### Get all departments
```
GET /api/departments
Authorization: Bearer ADMIN_TOKEN
```

### Delete a department
```
DELETE /api/departments/:id
Authorization: Bearer ADMIN_TOKEN
```

---

## 🔹 Print Request Management

### Create a new print request (Teacher Only)
```
POST /api/print-requests
Authorization: Bearer TEACHER_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "copies": 10,
  "description": "Exam papers"
}
```

### Get all print requests (Admin Only)
```
GET /api/print-requests
Authorization: Bearer ADMIN_TOKEN
```

### Get specific print request details
```
GET /api/print-requests/:id
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
```

### Get department print requests (Department Head Only)
```
GET /api/print-requests/department/:dept_id
Authorization: Bearer DEPT_HEAD_TOKEN
```

---

## 🔹 Approving & Processing Print Requests

### Approve a print request (Department Head Only)
```
PUT /api/print-requests/:id/approve
Authorization: Bearer DEPT_HEAD_TOKEN
```

### Mark a request as 'Printing' (Printing Staff Only)
```
PUT /api/print-requests/:id/process
Authorization: Bearer PRINTING_STAFF_TOKEN
```

### Mark a request as 'Completed' (Printing Staff Only)
```
PUT /api/print-requests/:id/complete
Authorization: Bearer PRINTING_STAFF_TOKEN
```

---

## 🔹 Dashboard & Statistics (Admin Only)

### Get total number of print requests
```
GET /api/stats/requests
Authorization: Bearer ADMIN_TOKEN
```

### Get breakdown of requests by status
```
GET /api/stats/requests/status
Authorization: Bearer ADMIN_TOKEN
```

### Get department-specific statistics
```
GET /api/stats/requests/department/:dept_id
Authorization: Bearer ADMIN_TOKEN
```

